WEBVTT

00:19.840 --> 00:21.280
What are you doing?!

00:21.280 --> 00:23.370
Remember the formations from our training!

00:26.800 --> 00:28.130
Empress!

00:28.400 --> 00:30.590
Clay Platoon, follow me!

00:30.590 --> 00:32.630
Kassim Platoon, get on the other side!

00:45.280 --> 00:46.150
Open formation!

00:50.530 --> 00:51.420
She's wide open!

00:51.420 --> 00:52.190
Take aim!

00:53.100 --> 00:53.780
Now!

00:53.780 --> 00:54.650
Fire!

00:56.660 --> 00:57.760
Keep it up!

00:57.760 --> 00:59.450
It's working just like we did in training!

00:59.450 --> 01:00.570
Now!

01:04.420 --> 01:05.620
I see now.

01:06.410 --> 01:10.090
Initiate long-range attacks once you're 
sure Clay Platoon has fallen back!

01:14.630 --> 01:16.940
So they're constantly 
targeting her blind spot.

01:16.940 --> 01:18.040
Yep.

01:18.040 --> 01:21.470
A fine strategy that puts their 
collective nature to good use.

01:23.220 --> 01:25.770
But there's one problem.

01:34.760 --> 01:40.620
Ordinary attacks won't inflict any 
damage on a dragon sheathed in scales.

01:41.270 --> 01:43.820
Well? What now?

03:17.800 --> 03:20.970
<b>Episode 4</b>

03:18.590 --> 03:20.970
<b>The Rosewood Academy Training Exercise</b>

03:27.280 --> 03:29.600
Please bring anyone who's injured this way!

03:29.600 --> 03:31.100
I'll tend to their wounds!

03:38.650 --> 03:41.310
It seems like you're waiting for something.

03:41.310 --> 03:44.570
However, this battle's going 
to come to an end before that.

03:46.450 --> 03:47.430
Don't let it hit you!

03:48.790 --> 03:50.560
Okay, now's your chance!

04:00.100 --> 04:01.300
Asmodeus!

04:06.970 --> 04:10.150
That may have done some paltry damage,

04:10.150 --> 04:12.030
but it looks like your plan has failed.

04:12.030 --> 04:13.690
No, it's more than enough.

04:17.520 --> 04:19.730
Now she's lost awareness of her surroundings.

04:27.300 --> 04:28.660
A pitfall?

04:28.660 --> 04:31.650
I thought you were fighting fair and square.

04:31.650 --> 04:34.860
It'd be an unfair trap if it 
had been set up beforehand,

04:34.860 --> 04:36.300
but that's not the case.

04:37.800 --> 04:39.130
He dug it out.

04:39.430 --> 04:41.650
After the battle had already begun.

04:42.930 --> 04:45.340
So you were stalling for time all along.

04:45.340 --> 04:48.640
That's not enough to beat her, though.

04:48.640 --> 04:49.810
I know that.

04:51.130 --> 04:53.380
Our real battle begins now.

04:58.860 --> 04:59.770
Go!

05:00.470 --> 05:02.150
Forgive me, Cu.

05:04.950 --> 05:06.390
Asmodeus!

05:06.880 --> 05:08.640
As mighty as I may be...

05:08.640 --> 05:09.120
Huh?

05:09.120 --> 05:12.160
Using me repeatedly like this...

05:12.160 --> 05:14.220
Don't be such a wimp!

05:18.550 --> 05:20.300
Leonard, can you keep fighting?

05:20.300 --> 05:21.670
Yes, my lord!

05:28.740 --> 05:29.640
Leonard!

05:31.090 --> 05:33.420
I've still got stamina to spare.

05:33.420 --> 05:37.240
I haven't failed to run those ten kilometers 
you asked of me every morning.

05:38.150 --> 05:39.030
I said what now?

05:39.030 --> 05:39.650
What?!

05:42.980 --> 05:44.110
She's about to take off!

05:45.460 --> 05:46.400
Earnest!

05:47.400 --> 05:48.660
W-Wait!

05:48.660 --> 05:49.660
I refuse!

05:53.410 --> 05:54.410
Sophie!

05:55.870 --> 05:59.420
Artificial Great Hero Power: 
Gravity Manipulation.

06:06.950 --> 06:08.470
Now, Earnest!

06:09.920 --> 06:12.930
Sheesh, you're working us to the bone...

06:15.270 --> 06:18.960
I command thee in the 
name of Earnest Flaming!

06:18.960 --> 06:21.560
O sword! Demonstrate thy power!

06:21.560 --> 06:24.690
No more... Pwease!

06:24.690 --> 06:27.570
Shut your trap!

06:31.160 --> 06:34.510
Who knew we had such a
 capable student at our school?

06:34.510 --> 06:36.460
It's not just her powers.

06:37.400 --> 06:41.710
Even in the advanced class, there aren't 
many who can hone their fighting spirit.

06:41.950 --> 06:42.980
But...

06:42.980 --> 06:45.250
Even us students in the lower classes...

06:45.250 --> 06:47.630
Can serve as conduits...

06:47.630 --> 06:49.320
To gather power from everyone!

06:49.320 --> 06:50.680
We also...

06:50.680 --> 06:53.130
Want to be friends with Cu!

06:55.360 --> 06:56.920
Please, Anna!

06:56.920 --> 06:58.560
Grant strength to my lord!

06:58.560 --> 06:59.470
Earnest!

06:59.470 --> 07:01.250
It's in your hands, Empress!

07:01.250 --> 07:02.810
Get her good, Anna!

07:02.810 --> 07:04.150
I leave the rest to you.

07:12.160 --> 07:15.160
Go forth!

07:15.160 --> 07:16.990
Get a good look, Cu.

07:17.490 --> 07:19.410
This is what humans can do.

07:45.400 --> 07:46.360
Cu.

07:47.370 --> 07:49.520
I ended up losing.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.400
You sure did.

07:51.400 --> 07:54.710
I disappointed you, Parent.

07:54.710 --> 07:57.380
Weak children get abandoned, right?

07:57.380 --> 07:59.150
I wouldn't do that.

08:00.620 --> 08:03.550
Besides, you're wrong about one thing.

08:03.550 --> 08:05.430
It's not that you were weak.

08:07.370 --> 08:09.160
Humans were just stronger.

08:11.630 --> 08:13.760
Well? Will you admit it now?

08:14.560 --> 08:15.330
Aye.

08:15.810 --> 08:18.640
Does that mean you can be friends with them?

08:22.940 --> 08:26.060
I-I suppose I must, if you insist.

08:26.060 --> 08:27.930
I don't mind becoming friends with—

08:27.930 --> 08:28.970
Hey!

08:28.970 --> 08:30.440
You know that's not it!

08:32.430 --> 08:33.450
U-Um...

08:34.000 --> 08:35.860
P-Please... be...

08:38.950 --> 08:41.950
Be friends with me!

08:46.800 --> 08:48.290
Of course!

08:54.640 --> 08:55.860
Let's get along, Cu!

08:55.860 --> 08:57.570
So cute!

08:58.990 --> 09:00.410
Hey, be careful!

09:03.940 --> 09:05.730
I see you're in high spirits, Gil.

09:06.170 --> 09:08.660
What are you scheming this time?

09:08.660 --> 09:11.420
I'm happy to see my students grow.

09:11.420 --> 09:15.740
Since they can harness their fighting 
spirit and spiritual energy now,

09:15.740 --> 09:19.740
I've arranged a training method
that's even more hands-on.

09:19.740 --> 09:21.740
By which you mean that device?

09:21.740 --> 09:22.880
Indeed.

09:22.880 --> 09:28.750
It's called virtual reality, made using a 
once-lost branch of magic called science.

09:30.530 --> 09:33.040
I eagerly await its completion!

09:41.510 --> 09:43.560
Cu, Cu.

09:43.560 --> 09:45.340
Okay, open wide.

09:45.770 --> 09:48.900
I-I can feed myself!

09:48.900 --> 09:51.990
In that case, are you 
going to sit by yourself?

09:53.300 --> 09:55.300
Here, open wide!

09:56.860 --> 09:58.820
Just this once.

10:00.980 --> 10:02.750
So cute!

10:03.370 --> 10:04.640
Now, c'mere!

10:04.640 --> 10:05.790
Sit here!

10:05.790 --> 10:06.950
Right here!

10:06.950 --> 10:09.330
You sure are demanding!

10:11.400 --> 10:13.180
So cute! So adorable!

10:13.180 --> 10:14.710
Cuddle, cuddle!

10:15.130 --> 10:18.400
Claire, stop it!

10:18.400 --> 10:19.800
Hey, Earnest...

10:21.140 --> 10:23.470
Is there something different about you?

10:23.470 --> 10:24.360
Huh?

10:25.720 --> 10:26.640
Hey!

10:26.640 --> 10:27.930
Blade!

10:27.930 --> 10:29.740
C'mon, man!

10:30.640 --> 10:32.480
You can't say that, Blade!

10:32.480 --> 10:35.020
You truly are despicable.

10:35.730 --> 10:39.080
Um... You really haven't changed.

10:39.080 --> 10:40.490
No, you have!

10:40.770 --> 10:42.370
You've totally changed!

10:42.780 --> 10:45.140
Pay him no mind, my lord.

10:45.610 --> 10:47.080
Your rotund self is just as lovely!

10:47.080 --> 10:49.000
Don't say it!

10:49.000 --> 10:50.440
Oh, yeah!

10:50.440 --> 10:51.770
It was your weight!

10:51.770 --> 10:53.290
You got fat!

10:53.290 --> 10:56.300
I <i>thought</i> you'd gotten bigger!

10:56.300 --> 10:58.040
I-I get it!

10:58.040 --> 11:00.330
Do you really need to rub it in?!

11:00.330 --> 11:02.930
Blade, you moron!

11:05.200 --> 11:06.680
Guilty.

11:07.200 --> 11:07.830
Eh?

11:08.800 --> 11:10.570
I was in the wrong?

11:10.570 --> 11:13.010
I wouldn't be surprised 
if you two were through!

11:13.010 --> 11:14.630
Through?

11:18.980 --> 11:21.700
There, there, Parent.

11:22.400 --> 11:24.990
Blade's really taking it hard.

11:24.990 --> 11:28.700
Well, it's been three days since 
Anna locked herself in her room.

11:30.190 --> 11:34.400
Who knew that being "through"
meant I couldn't see her anymore?

11:34.400 --> 11:35.500
That's not it.

11:35.500 --> 11:36.360
Huh?

11:36.360 --> 11:38.710
So what does "through" mean?

11:39.040 --> 11:44.220
It's like, "We can't be friends anymore!
We're through being friends!"

11:44.220 --> 11:45.840
What?!

11:45.840 --> 11:48.340
No! I don't want that at all!

11:48.340 --> 11:51.480
I wanna stay friends with Earnest!

11:51.480 --> 11:54.130
Will she forgive me if I apologize?

11:54.130 --> 11:55.520
I'll go and say sorry to her!

11:55.520 --> 11:56.940
Wait!

11:57.300 --> 12:01.220
Blade, you don't know why 
Anna's mad at you, right?

12:02.000 --> 12:05.140
You're only going to make her angrier!

12:06.720 --> 12:07.880
Yep.

12:07.880 --> 12:10.490
That's why we'll tag along as well.

12:10.490 --> 12:13.670
Yeah. I'm worried about how Anna's doing.

12:13.670 --> 12:15.830
And because we're friends, of course.

12:15.830 --> 12:16.890
Yeah!

12:18.750 --> 12:20.590
Thank you!

12:23.730 --> 12:24.840
Are you free?

12:25.350 --> 12:28.680
Blade's here to apologize 
for what he said.

12:32.840 --> 12:34.850
Anna, I'm opening the door.

12:46.350 --> 12:47.370
Anna...

12:47.840 --> 12:49.340
Are you crying?

12:49.340 --> 12:50.510
Is everything okay?

12:51.030 --> 12:52.370
Can we come in?

12:56.370 --> 12:58.840
Looks tasty!

12:59.220 --> 13:01.870
Let me have some, too!

13:01.870 --> 13:03.580
You've got so much!

13:01.870 --> 13:03.580
Hey, what?!

13:03.580 --> 13:05.290
You can spare some of it!

13:03.580 --> 13:05.290
Cu, you can see like this?!

13:05.290 --> 13:06.340
Give it to me!

13:05.290 --> 13:06.340
Someone turn on the lights!

13:08.850 --> 13:10.740
D-Don't look!

13:10.740 --> 13:14.350
Please, don't look at me!

13:14.730 --> 13:16.230
These desserts are so tasty!

13:16.230 --> 13:17.410
These desserts...

13:17.410 --> 13:19.360
So that's the culprit.

13:19.360 --> 13:22.750
Ever since our fight against Cu...

13:22.750 --> 13:25.350
I started feeling hungry all the time...

13:25.350 --> 13:26.680
Besides...

13:27.130 --> 13:31.370
I never realized before that all 
of this delicious food existed!

13:32.000 --> 13:33.630
Hey, Earnest...

13:33.630 --> 13:35.420
Let me ask you one thing.

13:35.420 --> 13:38.190
Are you and I through as friends?

13:38.190 --> 13:39.380
N-No way!

13:39.380 --> 13:43.640
I didn't... want you to see me like this.

13:43.640 --> 13:46.060
So I couldn't bear to talk with you...

13:46.980 --> 13:48.360
I see!

13:48.360 --> 13:50.260
So we aren't through, then!

13:50.260 --> 13:51.380
What a relief.

13:51.380 --> 13:52.210
Well, I'm leaving.

13:52.210 --> 13:53.730
Hold it right there!

13:53.730 --> 13:55.930
You can't be serious, Blade!

13:55.930 --> 13:58.880
If you leave now, Anna's 
gonna end up a lost cause!

13:58.880 --> 14:00.180
Something nice!

14:00.180 --> 14:02.860
You need to say something nice, or else!

14:03.360 --> 14:04.820
Something nice?

14:07.860 --> 14:09.300
Enjoying those desserts?

14:09.300 --> 14:10.350
Good for you.

14:11.830 --> 14:12.960
Blade!

14:12.960 --> 14:14.800
You're twisting the knife!

14:14.800 --> 14:15.710
Huh?!

14:15.710 --> 14:17.790
What should I say, then?

14:17.790 --> 14:19.770
Leonard, show him how it's done!

14:19.770 --> 14:20.790
Yes!

14:21.750 --> 14:25.070
My lord, I remain tirelessly devoted to you.

14:25.700 --> 14:28.220
No matter how overweight you may be.

14:28.220 --> 14:31.940
Who are you calling overweight?!

14:31.940 --> 14:33.140
Earnest.

14:34.470 --> 14:37.290
This isn't something you 
can deal with alone, is it?

14:38.620 --> 14:40.720
If not, then turn to us.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.640
All of us will help you out!

14:42.640 --> 14:43.650
What you need is training!

14:44.540 --> 14:46.780
We're friends, aren't we?

14:54.050 --> 14:56.200
Okay! I'll do it!

14:57.810 --> 14:59.240
Hey, stop eating!

15:08.650 --> 15:10.810
Should we go a little slower?

15:11.760 --> 15:13.530
If it doesn't hurt...

15:14.370 --> 15:17.180
I won't be burning calories!

15:18.140 --> 15:19.090
Step, step, step.

15:19.090 --> 15:20.200
19!

15:19.090 --> 15:20.880
You're doing great!

15:20.880 --> 15:22.000
20!

15:20.880 --> 15:24.020
I'm here to cheer you on as your friend!

15:22.920 --> 15:24.020
21!

15:24.020 --> 15:24.860
Step, step, step.

15:24.860 --> 15:26.360
Okay! Keep it up, Earnest!

15:26.360 --> 15:27.550
There! Push harder!

15:27.550 --> 15:28.150
Okay, good!

15:29.240 --> 15:30.480
Step, step, step.

15:36.000 --> 15:39.250
I had the kitchen prepare a
 special meal, just for you.

15:39.600 --> 15:41.860
Huh? That's all?

15:41.860 --> 15:42.730
Yes.

15:43.210 --> 15:45.660
You need to cut your calorie intake as well.

15:46.600 --> 15:49.260
I'm so hungry...

15:52.440 --> 15:55.100
The water feels so good!

16:07.520 --> 16:09.360
It's so hot!

16:23.210 --> 16:26.100
How come it hasn't gone down?!

16:26.100 --> 16:28.160
Yikes, that ain't good.

16:28.160 --> 16:29.710
This won't do.

16:29.710 --> 16:32.220
It almost feels like it's gone up.

16:32.460 --> 16:34.830
What's going on?!

16:32.700 --> 16:35.220
<b>THUD</b>

16:35.220 --> 16:36.790
Hey!

16:38.000 --> 16:38.830
How's it look?

16:38.830 --> 16:41.040
Hey! Don't peek!

16:45.040 --> 16:46.860
You're a real hero.

16:47.560 --> 16:48.640
N-No!

16:48.640 --> 16:49.510
Not at all!

16:49.510 --> 16:51.210
I'm definitely not a hero!

16:51.210 --> 16:53.070
I'm just an ordinary guy!

16:53.070 --> 16:54.020
What?

16:55.520 --> 16:59.090
You know, Anna, you should have 
put on some muscle from training.

16:59.090 --> 17:00.960
I'm sure you'll slim down in no time.

17:00.960 --> 17:02.410
You think?

17:02.670 --> 17:03.730
Yeah.

17:03.730 --> 17:08.500
If only there were an easier way 
to raise your metabolic rate.

17:11.160 --> 17:14.170
I wanted to try something a
 little more drastic today.

17:14.170 --> 17:15.670
Something drastic?

17:17.430 --> 17:18.210
Yeah.

17:20.300 --> 17:24.240
This is Testing Ground No. 2, and it's
 protected by a powerful magic barrier,

17:24.240 --> 17:26.690
so there shouldn't be any casualties,
 even if this goes wrong.

17:28.690 --> 17:29.900
Um...

17:29.900 --> 17:32.940
If I can pull this off and lose weight...

17:33.840 --> 17:35.710
can you praise me for it?

17:35.710 --> 17:37.390
Huh? Sure.

17:43.060 --> 17:45.830
I'm counting on you if 
anything happens, Blade.

17:45.830 --> 17:47.210
S-Sure.

17:48.710 --> 17:52.400
I command thee in the 
name of Earnest Flaming!

17:52.400 --> 17:54.500
O sword! Consume my flesh!

17:54.500 --> 17:56.610
Use it as thy power!

18:09.850 --> 18:10.810
That's...

18:21.480 --> 18:23.700
This is where you two were!

18:23.700 --> 18:26.040
Wait, what <i>is</i> that thing?!

18:26.040 --> 18:28.030
Is that Earnest?

18:28.030 --> 18:29.850
What? Anna?!

18:29.850 --> 18:32.180
Stay calm. Have faith in her.

18:32.180 --> 18:33.110
Still!

18:41.680 --> 18:43.600
Looks like it worked.

18:43.600 --> 18:45.810
But man, that was scorching hot.

18:45.810 --> 18:47.340
I thought I was gonna die.

18:47.340 --> 18:48.710
Verily.

18:48.710 --> 18:51.860
Thy flesh hath now perished.

18:52.100 --> 18:54.430
Huh? What's that voice?

18:54.430 --> 18:56.360
Asmodeus, probably.

18:56.650 --> 18:58.210
Hold thy head high with pride.

18:58.210 --> 19:03.620
'Tis not since thy first ancestor 
that one hath attained this form.

19:04.240 --> 19:06.870
What happened to Earnest's body?

19:07.390 --> 19:11.950
Succumbed flesh doth become 
flame by mine hand.

19:12.420 --> 19:17.610
An undying body,
wholly immune to attacks physical!

19:18.010 --> 19:19.430
Come!

19:19.430 --> 19:23.260
Where is thy nemesis, worthy of this form?

19:23.260 --> 19:26.640
Show me thy foe to set ablaze!

19:26.880 --> 19:28.820
My foe to set ablaze...

19:28.820 --> 19:30.890
That would be my body fat!

19:30.890 --> 19:31.590
Pardon?

19:32.260 --> 19:35.600
Because I did this all for my diet!

19:35.600 --> 19:36.980
Diet?

19:37.440 --> 19:39.860
I'm burning so much energy!

19:39.860 --> 19:42.160
It must use up a ton many calories!

19:42.400 --> 19:44.040
I-Indeed.

19:44.040 --> 19:48.850
The drawback to this demon form lies 
with the enormous energy it consumes.

19:48.850 --> 19:52.170
Maintaining this form requires 
one million calories every hour...

19:52.880 --> 19:54.670
One million!

19:55.060 --> 19:58.510
Who's got time to slowly 
jog off those pounds?!

19:58.510 --> 20:00.820
Just burn it all away in a flash!

20:01.900 --> 20:02.980
Yes! Yes!

20:05.570 --> 20:07.420
Hey, are you all right?

20:08.050 --> 20:10.110
I think I'm at my limit...

20:10.870 --> 20:13.140
<b>Grooooowl</b>

20:13.140 --> 20:15.410
I'm so hungry now...

20:15.410 --> 20:16.440
What?!

20:19.300 --> 20:21.950
I'm... hungry!

20:23.520 --> 20:26.000
She's gone into some kind of beast mode?!

20:26.000 --> 20:27.580
She grew a tail.

20:28.180 --> 20:30.700
Anna! Don't abandon your humanity!

20:32.240 --> 20:33.520
Claire...

20:34.020 --> 20:34.980
Thank goodness!

20:34.980 --> 20:36.480
She said my name!

20:36.480 --> 20:37.730
Claire...

20:37.730 --> 20:39.340
Looks tasty!

20:45.520 --> 20:47.510
Dragon Series, Third Sword.

20:49.010 --> 20:51.220
Dragon Banish!

20:51.860 --> 20:53.520
Wind pressure-only version.

21:20.270 --> 21:23.130
Blade, I...

21:24.440 --> 21:26.130
You did great.

21:36.760 --> 21:38.850
Don't look!

21:38.850 --> 21:40.570
Don't look at me!

21:40.840 --> 21:42.460
So you're eating again.

21:43.610 --> 21:45.070
I-It's fine, y'see!

21:45.070 --> 21:49.200
If I turn into a flame demon,
I can lose it again in no time! Y'see?!

21:49.200 --> 21:50.410
Y'see?

21:50.410 --> 21:52.440
That's an excuse for losers.

21:52.440 --> 21:53.930
I said it's fine!

21:53.930 --> 21:55.420
It's fine, okay?!

21:55.420 --> 21:57.710
It's fine!

21:58.700 --> 21:59.880
That's right!

21:59.880 --> 22:02.780
Dieting is the best!

23:34.510 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Time</b>

23:35.300 --> 23:39.980
<b>The Demon King's Daughter</b>
